{
  "name": "ondra-worldbook-scenes",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的场景卡：从人设包的 references/scenes.md 逐字解析出「触发 / 表面 / 台词 / 动作 / 收尾 / 硬规则」，按关键词命中（带否定邻域保护）、同组互斥、递归 ≤3 算出一轮只用一张骨架；渲染时剔除「内心」栏——推演不是台词，写进提示词她会把心里话念出来。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
